Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.28,0:00:04.85,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Replenish your divination energy\N in the spring water.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.16,0:00:08.32,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,With medicinal baths of all types,\N and a {\i1}huge{\i0} open-air bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.63,0:00:11.86,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Complete with delectable food\N and relaxing party lounges.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.24,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,This is an urara's paradise:
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.11,0:00:17.49,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,The Super Seeing Springs!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.12,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Well, girls?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.20,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Would you like a bath?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.20,0:00:21.44,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Would you like dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.54,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Or would you like...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.54,0:00:23.87,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Dinner!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.87,0:00:25.49,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Well, too bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.49,0:00:26.94,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,The bath comes first.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.94,0:00:28.10,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.92,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,You just wanted to say that line, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.68,0:00:33.86,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the arduous ninth-rank exam behind us,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.86,0:00:36.77,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,{\i1}tonight we're all celebrating our promotion!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.26,0:00:42.68,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,The path of destiny winds, \Nand the road of life branches.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.43,0:00:47.10,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,At times, people lose their way \Nin this labyrinth we all travel.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.27,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,But seek out a diviner, and they will \Nsurely lend an arrow to your decision.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.73,0:00:55.57,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,Though sometimes panacea\Nand sometimes poison,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.57,0:00:58.16,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,their mystical powers can provide a guiding beacon.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.57,0:01:02.87,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,The ones who can wield this power \Nare girls of at least fifteen years in age.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.58,0:01:06.12,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,Sometimes goddesses,\Nsometimes witches—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.12,0:01:08.81,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,Such are the girls of this town of divination...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.81,0:01:09.92,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,...urara!
Comment: 10,0:01:09.92,0:01:09.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.00,0:02:47.35,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,They're so fluttery!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.34,0:02:49.86,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Chiya?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.82,0:02:52.30,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Flipped our skirts, did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.82,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,We'll arrest you for indecency!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.07,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.04,0:02:59.12,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Flip all you want. There's nothing to see.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.91,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,We've got our one-piece uniform underneath.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.91,0:03:01.72,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.78,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Don't lift your skirts yourselves!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.11,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,They tend to get in the way. \NWe could honestly do without them.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.11,0:03:08.10,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,Plus, they're stuffy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.99,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,But you can't do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.99,0:03:10.50,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.81,0:03:12.29,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,If you don't have anything to flip up,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.29,0:03:15.25,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,you'll grow up to be dull like Captain Saku!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.25,0:03:18.04,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,G-Grow up to be... dull?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.16,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Don't take it the wrong way, Saku!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.16,0:03:23.80,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Being dull is one of your good points!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.80,0:03:24.64,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.64,0:03:27.93,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Dull as you may be, Captain, you have your own...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.93,0:03:31.23,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,You have a splendid appeal that none can match!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.77,0:03:35.40,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}Namely, an impeccable shorts-socks gap!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.60,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,F-For some reason, I just got a chill down my spine.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.05,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.05,0:03:43.14,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,You'd better warm up in the bath immediately!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.24,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,We shall report back with the water conditions!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.24,0:03:46.70,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Off we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.96,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on just a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.96,0:03:52.85,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,This just occurred to me, \Nbut why are those two even here?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.85,0:03:54.52,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,I invited them.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.08,0:04:00.08,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,For a celebration like this,\N I thought, the more the merrier.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.17,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Should I not have?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.34,0:04:06.88,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,No, they deserve some relaxation too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.88,0:04:10.47,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Those two put in a lot \Nof hard work every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.47,0:04:12.32,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Such kindness from Captain Saku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.32,0:04:15.81,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,We'll soak it in today \Nwith every inch of our bodies!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.88,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Just go already!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.22,0:04:23.53,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nono! Sorry, could you help me out a bit here?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.34,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can you untie the ribbon back there for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.37,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,{\an8}You mean this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.78,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.78,0:04:30.65,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}I tied it a bit too tight.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.65,0:04:33.33,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,{\an8}Koume, what's that weird thing you're wearing?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.33,0:04:34.49,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's not weird!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.49,0:04:35.69,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's a corset!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.93,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,A corset?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.93,0:04:37.54,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.44,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Simply put it on, and your belly gets slimmer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.82,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,It's like magic!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.82,0:04:43.58,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Your belly gets slimmer?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.94,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Ladies in the West swear by it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.94,0:04:47.57,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Isn't that thing suffocating?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.57,0:04:51.02,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,A girl must be prepared to suffer to be cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.81,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,What kind of philosophy is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.19,0:04:54.69,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Well, I won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.69,0:04:58.11,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Koume without a squishy belly \Nwouldn't be Koume at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.52,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Are you {\i1}trying{\i0} to provoke me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.06,0:05:02.42,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were clothes like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.78,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,I'd kind of like to have one, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.78,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Interested, Nono?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.58,0:05:10.84,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,M-My body's not very developed,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.84,0:05:15.21,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,but maybe if I wear that, \NI'll look a bit more like Onee-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.69,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Nina-sensei certainly has a nice figure.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.69,0:05:20.17,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,So grown-up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.13,0:05:25.26,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,"This coming from Chiya-chan and Kon-chan, \Nwho are plenty shapely themselves."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.32,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.32,0:05:28.36,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,It's not fair, is it, Matsuko-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.47,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You're scaring me, Nono!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.77,0:05:31.46,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Well, wanna try it on?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.46,0:05:32.22,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.34,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.34,0:05:35.73,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,We're gonna be naked soon enough, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.40,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Let's first have some fun \Nby swapping outfits!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.08,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Though it won't be much fun\N if only Nono participates...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.82,0:05:46.53,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,No, no, no! I can't do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.53,0:05:52.49,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Wh-Why do I have to trade clothes with Chiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.42,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.36,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,It's a lot more interesting if we swap four ways.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.36,0:06:00.22,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I'll bet it feels nice to wear \Nsomething different for a change.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.52,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel nice at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.52,0:06:04.14,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I feel all exposed!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.26,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I feel all exposed where I {\i1}really{\i0} shouldn't!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.26,0:06:09.18,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Of everything so far, this is the most unbearable!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.55,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,How about you, Chiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.47,0:06:15.21,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Why, aren't you the perfect little lady?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.58,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,It's a good look for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.58,0:06:17.81,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Lucky you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.77,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I-It's stifling!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.24,0:06:22.26,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,A kimono over a shirt?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.26,0:06:25.45,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,This has got to be some kind of test of will!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.53,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Equally unbearable, it seems.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.06,0:06:28.99,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.90,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,H-How is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.90,0:06:35.30,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Can I pull off Koume-chan's witch look?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.87,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,"Matsuko's a witch, too!"
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.87,0:06:38.96,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You look great in that, Nono!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.10,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Do I look grown up?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.34,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.34,0:06:43.38,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You'd give Nina-sensei a run for her money!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.36,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Koume?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.36,0:06:46.70,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I-I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.70,0:06:47.59,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's cute...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.08,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,What are you pouting for?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.08,0:06:51.48,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I wasn't pouting!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.01,0:06:57.64,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I'm not jealous or anything, just 'cause \Nshe looks more like a real witch than me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.90,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,If only I had blonde hair too...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.82,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aww...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.82,0:07:04.65,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.53,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.24,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Why, we had no idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.11,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Koume-chan, you're the one being cute here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.36,0:07:14.08,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.31,0:07:16.03,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,You little cutie, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.21,0:07:19.60,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,What are those four giggling about?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.74,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Saku!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.70,0:07:24.68,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Well? How do I look?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.68,0:07:27.48,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Maybe I should join the Watch, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.42,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Don't play with my uniform!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.67,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,It's a bit big on me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.67,0:07:33.95,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,For goodness' sake...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.93,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and get ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.74,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,That's right, Saku.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.74,0:07:41.64,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,I'd like your help with something\N before we get in the bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.47,0:07:46.01,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,This feels so nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.01,0:07:48.65,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Tokie-san really should have joined us.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.65,0:07:52.41,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,No, my mother is the proprietor\N of Tatsumi-ya, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.17,0:07:57.12,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Though I did get a chance to talk \Nto her briefly after the exam.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.67,0:08:00.51,GJM_Main,Tokie,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kon, congratulations on passing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.51,0:08:01.46,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mother...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.80,0:08:07.10,GJM_Main,Tokie,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though surely you don't mean to tell me\N that you're satisfied with just this.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.17,GJM_Main,Tokie,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you wish to prove yourself, \Nhurry and claw your way up to where I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.63,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,...is what she said.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.63,0:08:15.45,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Are you mother and daughter or archrivals?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.15,0:08:18.42,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Rivals? Not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.42,0:08:22.73,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I'm far from being able to stand \Non equal footing with my mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.72,0:08:28.08,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,But someday I want to be an urara just like...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.54,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,no, even better than my mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.32,0:08:35.85,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,That's why I left Tatsumi-ya, \Nwhere my mother is, and came here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.40,0:08:40.45,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Of course, thanks to that, I met all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.45,0:08:43.68,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I found companions on my journey\N to becoming a first-rank ura.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.83,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I couldn't be more blessed!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.94,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Kon-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.55,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Don't you lose that face \Nwhen you grow up, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.07,0:08:54.37,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.37,0:08:56.66,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,What do you wanna eat \Nonce we get out of the bath?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.66,0:08:57.80,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Meat and anmitsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.26,0:08:59.98,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Since this is a special occasion,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.98,0:09:03.45,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I think I can get away with indulging\N in the Koume Deluxe.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.45,0:09:04.56,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.56,0:09:08.27,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You've got yourself to blame \Nif you get stuck in a hole again.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.71,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,You're up, Chiya. Death by a thousand pokes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.03,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.03,0:09:14.16,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Poke, poke, poke.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.43,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.47,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.47,0:09:17.99,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,No horsing around in the bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.43,0:09:20.12,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,It's quite unseemly.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.16,0:09:22.65,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Refreshments in the bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.65,0:09:24.70,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Isn't {\i1}that{\i0} unseemly?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.70,0:09:25.84,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.84,0:09:28.13,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Nina-sensei and Captain Saku \Nget to break the rules!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.99,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,This doesn't count!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.99,0:09:34.58,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Alcohol is like a bath to cleanse the heart for adults!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.58,0:09:36.55,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Right, Saku?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.55,0:09:37.14,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.55,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Excuses...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.94,0:09:43.72,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Still, it's hard to believe \Nyou're all ninth-rank ura already.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.60,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,You still remember, Chiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.60,0:09:50.44,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,That night you tried to sneak into Ninth District.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.48,0:09:53.34,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.34,0:09:54.53,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.94,0:09:59.53,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Look at you now, working hard \Nand sticking to your promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.06,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, Chiya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.95,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,Captain Saku!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.44,0:10:07.29,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,And why are you lining up?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.29,0:10:08.84,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Don't mind us.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.84,0:10:11.14,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,We're simply waiting in the head pat queue!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.13,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Well you're not getting any!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.13,0:10:13.96,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.96,0:10:17.08,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,I can't believe they akshally passhed!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.08,0:10:21.22,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}I knew my shtudents wouldn't let me down!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.88,0:10:21.22,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,She's already long gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.63,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.63,0:10:25.16,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,No, this is just the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.24,0:10:28.54,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Nina's all jolly when she first gets tipsy,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.54,0:10:28.58,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{\clip(239,667,1038,689)}Nina's all jolly when she first gets tipsy,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.35,0:10:28.39,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640.91,13.89)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.39,0:10:28.44,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640.03,146.7)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.44,0:10:28.48,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640.01,320.02)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.48,0:10:28.52,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640.01,493.36)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.52,0:10:28.56,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,626.67)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.56,0:10:28.73,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,679.99)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.73,0:10:29.31,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,680)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.31,0:10:30.96,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,680.01)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.96,0:10:31.00,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=0}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,680.01)\clip(306,645,997,709)}but soon enough she'll be bawling.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.81,0:10:30.86,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640.03,35.03)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.86,0:10:30.90,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,213.33)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.90,0:10:30.94,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(639.99,426.36)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.94,0:10:30.98,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(639.99,605.08)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.98,0:10:31.02,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,680.06)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.02,0:10:31.15,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(639.99,680)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.15,0:10:32.90,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,{=1}{\1a&H00&\3a&H00&\4a&HA0&\pos(640,680)}Then she'll start singing, dancing,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.92,0:10:35.12,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,and divining for whoever's in reach.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.28,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.53,0:10:37.84,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Then the next morning,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.84,0:10:41.72,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,I have to deal with her trying to commit \Nharakiri once the realization hits her.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.02,0:10:46.84,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Still, I guess that's part of what makes Nina cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.84,0:10:49.62,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Are you drunk too, Captain Saku?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.62,0:10:53.25,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone! Listen up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.98,0:10:55.84,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,This song has been in Natsume-ya for generations,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.26,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,as an expression of what it means to be an urara.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.26,0:11:02.22,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hot Springs Folk Song, Wishy Wash-Wash"!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.67,0:11:07.06,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Da-dum, ba-da-dum... Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.06,0:11:08.34,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wishy wash-wash!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.34,0:11:08.99,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.14,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wishy wash-wash!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.14,0:11:10.77,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.10,0:11:14.37,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Come on down to the hot springs,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.37,0:11:16.69,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,and lay your body bare!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.52,0:11:18.79,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.96,0:11:18.79,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Wow! Awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.65,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Bravo, Nina!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.46,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,S-Saku-chan, what do we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.98,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Aw, Nina, you're tha besht...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.47,0:11:29.15,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Show her your appreciation.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.15,0:11:32.00,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,And then respond in kind...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.64,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,with your own signature party tricks!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.64,0:11:36.42,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Oh no, we've lost her...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.42,0:11:37.86,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Party tricks, is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.86,0:11:38.94,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.76,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.55,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Chiya, flip!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.49,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.49,0:11:54.31,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Avoiding exposure by a hair each time!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.31,0:11:56.15,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,A titillating exchange of attacks and parries!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.88,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.28,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.74,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,You're completely exposed from behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.70,0:12:06.88,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.88,0:12:09.66,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,And lay your body bare!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.66,0:12:11.16,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.16,0:12:12.14,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.14,0:12:16.26,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}And thus the baffling hot springs\N party trick competition went on.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.26,0:12:19.47,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}As my majestic dance soothed \Nthe hearts of all who watched...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.47,0:12:20.26,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soothed?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.67,0:12:23.71,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and the already intoxicated adults\N went from bad to worse,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.71,0:12:26.47,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}our time passed in merriment.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.43,0:12:28.54,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}However,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.54,0:12:32.21,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}none of us yet had any idea...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.90,0:12:36.06,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\i1}that a terrible calamity was about to be upon us.
Comment: 10,0:12:36.94,0:12:36.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Part B
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.22,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Gosh, you scared us back there!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.22,0:12:42.90,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now everyone's sick from fooling\N around too much in the bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.90,0:12:45.42,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Though I guess I'm not one to talk...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.42,0:12:47.42,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\an8}S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.42,0:12:51.66,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\an8}I just wanted to properly celebrate \Nour ninth-rank promotion together.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.07,0:12:53.62,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kon-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.62,0:12:57.88,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Then we'd better do some divination\N once Nina-sensei wakes up.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.33,0:13:02.01,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's show her how much we've learned!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.39,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,{\an8}My ninth-rank emblem is gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.85,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.41,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,So is mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.58,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.60,0:13:13.35,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Undulette is, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.73,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I can't find my kokkuri paper, either!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.73,0:13:18.06,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,M-M-M...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.06,0:13:20.63,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Matsuko-san is gone, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.14,0:13:24.95,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,Nono!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.88,0:13:32.29,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,The theft must have occurred during \Nthe forty-or-so minutes we were in the bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.60,0:13:35.21,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Who would do this, and why?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.50,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.63,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,But we have to find our things!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.62,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.62,0:13:42.19,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,We worked hard for those emblems!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.76,0:13:44.49,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.49,0:13:45.66,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Did you find something?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.66,0:13:48.39,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,This is one of Matsuko-san's hairs.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.39,0:13:49.07,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.07,0:13:49.76,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.92,0:13:51.64,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Over there, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.28,0:13:55.43,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,And here... and here... and there's more!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.04,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.05,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,It's Matsuko-san's shedding season.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.05,0:14:00.77,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Shedding?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.77,0:14:03.90,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,If we follow these, we should find Matsuko-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.90,0:14:05.26,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Now hang on a second!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.40,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Something's not right here!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.88,0:14:07.88,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.88,0:14:11.38,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Animals lose a lot of hairs when\N the seasons change, don't they?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.38,0:14:12.66,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,A-Animals?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.66,0:14:14.14,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,For now, let's just follow!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.14,0:14:15.24,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.83,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Isn't Matsuko-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.22,0:14:19.81,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.60,0:14:25.55,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,The trail of Matsuko-san's hairs stops here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.76,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Y-You mean to say...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.43,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.27,0:14:35.52,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,What is it, Chiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.74,0:14:38.54,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I smell something sweet over that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.95,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Something sweet?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.95,0:14:41.02,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.02,0:14:42.88,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.88,0:14:46.03,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,It's kinda like if you stewed \Nsugar and soy sauce together...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.03,0:14:48.29,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,You mean like glazed rice dumplings?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.29,0:14:49.28,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.30,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You got that just from the ingredients?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.30,0:14:54.66,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Heh-heh! I'm not an Arinsu regular for nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.66,0:14:59.92,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,But glazed rice dumplings have nothing\N to do with our divination tools...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.17,0:15:01.00,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,But they do!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.50,0:15:04.78,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I just remembered,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.78,0:15:07.76,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,but while I was snacking on \Nglazed rice dumplings yesterday,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.93,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I got just a bit of the sauce on Undulette.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.22,0:15:12.01,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,D-Did you, now?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.39,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Of course, I wiped her clean afterwards!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.98,0:15:17.70,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Chiya-chan noticed it because her nose is so sharp.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.70,0:15:20.85,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I can't figure out where it's coming from.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.49,0:15:25.52,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,It's this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.52,0:15:26.83,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.83,0:15:28.49,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Wait up, Kon-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.76,0:15:39.18,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,H-Here?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.50,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Yes, most likely.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.63,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,How do you know, Kon?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.63,0:15:44.00,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.29,0:15:45.44,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Ants!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.44,0:15:49.46,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I get it! Ants line up in the\N direction of something sweet!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.84,0:15:52.43,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,And if we follow the trail of ants...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.01,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.82,0:16:08.44,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Found something!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.04,0:16:12.40,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,It was hidden in a nook behind the waterfall.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.38,0:16:14.53,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I'm opening it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.62,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.30,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,And Matsuko-san's hair is silky smooth!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.30,0:16:25.61,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,She must have grown her new coat!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.61,0:16:26.86,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Now hold on.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.28,0:16:31.97,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,I'm so, so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.97,0:16:35.59,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,We never would have thought \Nyou were behind it, Nina-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.93,0:16:40.68,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,I wanted to imbue your divination tools \Nand ninth-rank emblems with power,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.78,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,so we brought them to the \NWarding Waterfall for purification.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.78,0:16:46.97,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,We were going to tell you in the bath,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.97,0:16:49.71,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,but we didn't expect to get so drunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.11,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.63,0:16:55.57,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Nina-sensei, what sort of power \Ndoes that waterfall imbue?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.41,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,The power to protect urara.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.41,0:17:02.66,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,That way you'd have something\N to look after you in my place.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.33,0:17:06.00,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,"In my place"?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.26,0:17:07.26,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Don't give us that!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.00,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,It's not like you're going away or something!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.31,0:17:15.56,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,In fact, now that you've become ninth-rank ura,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.56,0:17:18.65,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,you will be living at a school in Ninth District.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.96,0:17:21.74,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,You'll be separated from me
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.74,0:17:25.44,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,and join the other promoted \Nstudents to further your training...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.44,0:17:27.68,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Wait, really? That sounds like so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.69,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,A-Aren't you sad?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.84,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Well, of course we're sad!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.84,0:17:34.32,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,We all love you, Nina-sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.61,0:17:39.47,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,A-And I'm worried about \Nliving away from Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.22,0:17:43.20,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,But I'll do my best with everyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.47,0:17:48.98,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You've made it clear how much \Nyou care about us, Nina-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.35,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,So don't worry!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.35,0:17:53.88,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,We'll be there for each other \Nfrom here on out!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.88,0:17:55.42,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nina-sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.71,0:17:57.46,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Y-You girls...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.46,0:17:59.26,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Guess you'd better keep cheering them on.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.80,0:18:02.39,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,We will remain in Tenth District, Ane-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.22,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,That we will, Ane-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.94,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.94,0:18:07.33,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,Then how about Mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.33,0:18:08.48,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,And Dad!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.19,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Why is that me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.19,0:18:13.66,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,I can already see our new family taking shape!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.69,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,We will gladly be the children!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.69,0:18:17.45,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,What are you two even talking about?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.85,0:18:19.36,GJM_Main,Ooshima,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.36,0:18:22.06,GJM_Main,Shiozawa,0,0,0,,...we want to be part of Captain Saku's life!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.16,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Our fantasies are born of love!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.50,0:18:27.81,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,C-Could you not shout nonsense\N at the top of your lungs?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.81,0:18:28.42,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,To{\alpha&HFF&}tally worth it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.04,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Totally {\alpha&HFF&}worth it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.04,0:18:29.92,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Totally worth {\alpha&HFF&}it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.00,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Totally worth it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.74,0:18:36.42,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,What is it, Chiya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.42,0:18:39.05,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.77,0:18:46.56,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,{\q2}I was thinking how I got this far thanks to all \Nthe people supporting, protecting, and helping me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.67,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.67,0:18:52.81,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,That's why we've got to take the next\N step toward our dreams by ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.71,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Hey, Kon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.71,0:18:58.99,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I tell you something?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.41,0:19:03.86,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I think I've gotten a step closer to my mom, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.54,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Back in that labyrinth...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.49,0:19:10.11,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I was so glad, but also just a bit scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.11,0:19:11.17,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.84,0:19:14.50,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I found out my mom's name.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.16,0:19:15.88,GJM_Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yami...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.88,0:19:18.72,GJM_Main,Spirits,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sinful urara... Yami...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.72,0:19:22.92,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,And all those black monsters I met in the labyrinth,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.92,0:19:27.69,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,seemed to really hate both my mom and me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.60,0:19:31.81,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Did you figure out where your mother is?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.18,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Why not summon that "Kurou" thing,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.18,0:19:37.78,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,and have it use its power\N to show you where your mom is?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.92,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I tried, but I couldn't summon it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.54,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.41,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I have no idea why it didn't work.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.16,0:19:49.04,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I guess all we've got is another mystery.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.04,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Well, maybe that's for the best.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.87,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,It's like Chiya said once—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.20,0:19:56.07,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,It's more fun not to know some things.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.76,0:19:57.71,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Kon...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.00,0:20:01.84,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Looking at it now, I think I get what you meant.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.14,0:20:04.43,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I just feel this sort of excitement.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.16,0:20:07.18,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.43,0:20:12.44,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I may have found a lot more questions,\N but I also found at least one answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.98,0:20:16.45,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,If I keep smiling and move \Nforward without looking back,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.45,0:20:18.57,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I'm bound to meet my mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.15,0:20:22.17,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I came to Labyrinth Town!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.17,0:20:24.95,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,That's right! I'm sure you'll meet her someday!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.95,0:20:25.84,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.11,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.11,0:20:30.21,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Or do you not believe this future\N first-rank ura's prophecy?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.87,0:20:32.52,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,No, I believe you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.52,0:20:34.15,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.07,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.07,0:20:41.95,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,According to the divination \Nof fellow future first-rank Miss Plum...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.95,0:20:42.82,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Sounds fishy!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.82,0:20:44.38,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,And probably not accurate!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.01,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Oh-hoh! I See it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.53,0:20:51.91,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,It is certain that even more fun times\N await us tomorrow and beyond!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.91,0:20:53.93,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,If the four of us stick together, \Nthere's no doubt.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.93,0:20:54.73,GJM_Main,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.80,0:20:58.98,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Fun times, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.56,0:21:02.61,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,Say, I wonder what sort of place Ninth District is.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.61,0:21:05.39,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,I wonder what the school is like.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.39,0:21:07.12,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,Think there'll be witches there?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.32,0:21:11.26,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,I-I wonder if we might make some new friends...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.26,0:21:13.87,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Then maybe we could do kokkuri together...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.40,0:21:17.83,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Ooh, I just can't wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.14,0:21:18.92,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.92,0:21:20.21,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,Let's go right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.00,0:21:22.30,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Chiya!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.30,0:21:23.26,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.64,0:21:24.81,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.81,0:21:27.22,GJM_Main,Chiya,0,0,0,,I've got a ninth-rank emblem now, see?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.90,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,That's not the issue!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.90,0:21:30.43,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Goodness...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.65,0:21:32.09,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.09,0:21:35.00,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't you dare go running outside like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.00,0:21:36.86,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Ooshima, Shiozawa, after them!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.86,0:21:37.52,GJM_Main,Both,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.84,0:21:38.96,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.96,0:21:41.03,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,I can't help but worry about them.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.03,0:21:44.10,GJM_Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll go back to school with them!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.10,0:21:44.99,GJM_Main,Saku,0,0,0,,Nina!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.22,0:21:47.99,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Labyrinth Town.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.68,0:21:51.55,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,{\i1}A town of divination as yet full of mysteries.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.33,0:21:51.23,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.52,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an7}Stop right there, Chiya!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.52,0:21:53.54,GJM_Main,Nono,0,0,0,,{\an7}Chiya-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.29,0:21:57.17,GJM_Main,Narr,0,0,0,,{\i1}What will become of the young girls' dreams?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.69,0:21:57.17,GJM_Main,Kon,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait, seriously!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.17,0:21:58.38,GJM_Main,Koume,0,0,0,,{\an8}Chiya!
